# The images are built from the package and the files its metadata reads, and
# nothing else, so a stray .env, a data folder or a model cache in a checkout
# never reaches a build, let alone an image layer. Everything is left out, then
# the few files the build needs are let back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!vectrixdb/

# Compiled files from a local run, and the models the wheel leaves out anyway.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
vectrixdb/models/data/dense
vectrixdb/models/data/dense_en
vectrixdb/models/data/reranker
vectrixdb/models/data/bge-m3
vectrixdb/models/data/rebel
